    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom apartment to the market at No. 74 Knockmaree, Chapelizod, Dublin 20. Presented in clean condition throughout, this bright and spacious home offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike to acquire a property within a highly sought-after and exceptionally well-maintained development.\nIdeally located in the picturesque village of Chapelizod, No. 74 enjoys the perfect balance of peaceful residential living and excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre. Chapelizod is renowned for its charming village atmosphere, scenic walks along the River Liffey and the nearby Phoenix Park, while offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, local shops and everyday amenities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby, and benefits from easy access to the N4, M50 and Dublin City Centre, making it an ideal location for commuters. A host of schools, sporting facilities and recreational amenities are also within easy reach.\nInternally, the accommodation is well laid out and in good overall condition, briefly comprising of c. 61 sqm consisting of a welcoming entrance hall, two generous double bedrooms (one with balcony), main bathroom, kitchen area and a bright and spacious open plan living/dining area, also featuring a balcony to the front. Located on the second floor, the property and development is well maintained and presents in good, clean condition throughout.\nFurther benefits include one designated parking space and a position within a mature, well-maintained development that is highly regarded for its attractive surroundings and convenient location.\nNo. 74 Knockmaree represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a well-presented apartment in one of West Dublin's most desirable residential locations, where a wealth of amenities and excellent transport links are all within easy reach.\n________________________________________\nKey Features\n• C. 61sqm of floorspace\n• BER B\n• 2 bed/1 bath apartment \n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• One designated parking space included\n• Located in a highly sought-after development \n• Mature and exceptionally well-maintained surroundings\n• Excellent transport links with easy access to Dublin City Centre, N4 and M50\n• Close to Chapelizod Village and Phoenix Park\n• Designated Parking\n• Excellent public transport nearby\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors\nDirections \nEircode - D20 C623\n"
      },
      {
